# Scope board

Canonical detail: `docs/backend-design.md` (decisions + build order) and `docs/User-Stories-and-Requirements.tex`. After a TBD is **decided by the user**, update this file.

## V1 (only when asked)

Auth (email verify, username or email login); community routing; community + group applications and approval queues (A19–A25); admin records, member list / door list, statistics (A28–A33); A1; DM/groups; leave DM (keep+block / delete+block); blocks hide profile; posts/images/Taken in app tag; reactions (one per person) + any-emoji picker; comments with snippet; admin delete; sticky + calendar (edit/delete, DM Admin); group settings incl. posting/commenting/reactions/visible in search/apply requirements; group create by admin or members with rights; F1/F2; profile builder (all field types, Status-driven fields, couples); profile score; linked profiles (max 3); profile visibility; form search + swipe browse (A27); find new user/group; albums + lock; notes/stars; Ads tab + filter.

## Later

Video/audio; disappearing posts; notifications; co-admins; hide usernames; payments; reputation; km distance; monetized ads; AI verify; Google login; self-serve multi-community; translations (structure ready now).

## TBD — do not guess

Levels 1–3 · Q1–Q8 in `docs/backend-design.md` §13 (District list, score rule, couples, search visibility, approve buttons, real-name visibility, link acceptance, same password), built with defaults.

## Decided (Oct 2026)

3 tabs Chats/Profiles/Ads · path `/{community}` · separate account per community · Ads tab kept · one profile image (more photos are photo fields, D16) · direct join is a group setting · first fields built by the admin
